{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And there was strife.</b> Because Lot's herdsmen were wicked and would graze their livestock in others' fields, and Abram's herdsmen would reprove them for the theft, and they would say: The land was given to Abram, and he has no heir, and Lot is his heir — so this is not theft. And Scripture says: ״וְהַכְּנַעֲנִי וְהַפְּרִזִּי אָז יֹשֵׁב בָּאָרֶץ״ — and Abram had not yet acquired possession of it."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:31.495356431Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}